        <div class="service-icon ic-pink">🔐</div>
        <h3>Privacy &amp; Security</h3>
        <p>Secure your devices, protect your social media, and set strong passwords safely.</p>
        <a href="services.html" class="learn-more">Learn more →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon ic-yellow">🖨️</div>
        <h3>Printer &amp; Scanner Setup</h3>
        <p>Wi-Fi printing, new printer setup, ink issues, and scan-to-email configuration.</p>
        <a href="services.html" class="learn-more">Learn more →</a>
      </div>

