        <div class="service-icon ic-indigo">🖥️</div>
        <h3>Remote IT Support</h3>
        <p>We connect securely to your device and fix issues without needing to visit — fast and easy.</p>
        <a href="services.html" class="learn-more">Learn more →</a>
